{"title":"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A cowboy is 4 miles south of a stream which flows due east. He is also 8 miles west and 7 miles north of his cabin. He wishes to water his horse at the stream and return home. The shortest distance (in miles) he can travel and accomplish this is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/d/50d98f9c21d4b879f40b16b274edea1a553062dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4+\\sqrt{185} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 16 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 17 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 18 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\sqrt{32}+\\sqrt{137}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"530\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, you draw a reflection of the cowboy across the river. Then, you draw the straight line from the \"cowboy\" to his cabin. This will be a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/f/9dfe9588c41665fe731b55cb96f8bcaa04db3fde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8, 15, 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" /> Pythagorean triple, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME\" title=\"1973 AHSME\">1973 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1973 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1973\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 